# P3, member a (k7): stands near the lobby's mat matz00 and takes a picture every 45 frames while b walks over it into
# stagml12 (the round 60 review: b's figure faded out on the mat, came back there about three seconds later and stood
# two seconds until its last presence turned stale).
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
talk until control,frames>=60
log in the lobby
idle until epoch>=@84
goto -25 -45 6
idle until epoch>=@112
log b to the mat
idle until frames>=90
shot a_mat_1
idle until frames>=45
shot a_mat_2
idle until frames>=45
shot a_mat_3
idle until frames>=45
shot a_mat_4
idle until frames>=45
shot a_mat_5
idle until frames>=45
shot a_mat_6
idle until frames>=45
shot a_mat_7
idle until frames>=45
shot a_mat_8
idle until frames>=45
shot a_mat_9
idle until frames>=45
shot a_mat_10
idle until frames>=120
log done
